Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 12:59:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] acpc: decode ANSI styles in Markdown agent replies

Convert agent-supplied ANSI styling into terminal spans before wrapping and table measurement. Preserve Markdown styles across SGR resets and keep original protocol source offsets. Gate the behavior on acpc mode and cover bilingual replies, colors, controls, tables and streaming suffixes with regression tests.
